<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado beheaded six Christians and killed a Catholic priest after a baptism of 175 people, while security forces captured six alleged terrorists in Macomia. Mozambican forces killed three robbers at a micro-credit service, an incident outside the insurgency. The United States warned of a growing ISIS threat to African maritime trade and oil prices rebounded after shipping attacks near Hormuz. Flood releases from the Pongolapoort dam have raised flood risk in Maputo province, and there were 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5nUHJNZG5wNTNoTEJoeXYzWlhhNlIxcXFYclhQQVdKdkJ5d0ExWjBpR1NFRWpkSmQxeHd1dUNTYk1jaVpicXRFbi1za1p0WHhFWDJUNmlHbUlvM3NXTXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE83S1BYT0d4akJiRXBMSmNFbWZBY2drQkIxQmJFT3A1T1ZDdEhSOTFNbE1XR3cxcHBDeTF4SFZ5ZFpHV3kteFQ0ajBPb25BX0JrM2dmTDU4ZXJIMXRSeVBLU1daOGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Jagonews24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFB2Z1ZXSUliREM1Nk5UaDFPcmd1dUtueEdVNF9fMEpRU2c1MnJOXzFxbmxkbjB5XzRuN1ZxTV9GVnYtVTdWWWo0eFVXOTlucVFr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Agenzia Fides&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1palNuYW5FeWo4MUZDNDJJWVdDNXlPbDlMOVVQT3JWQzVodnlvRXk4QnJITmpyZ2R3M0x5c29SUFBYWUQtYm9xQ0hMV25uWTQ5d014dnhseFJBUm1LV2lOZ29kbnJZSXU4YldfM0VJUUM0SlVIMVozU0cyOGVnRDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;aimnews.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPSkM3VS1LVEtmRWQzNGNSdUthVWgwX3dJRU1ZLThLa2FQTnlWNUloVHoxdUx3TXlYU0kzem0tTjUwdHBiMklYY0lfSEZQWUNGR1piVVR